# Behavioral Interview Prep

This repository contains behavioral interview preparation materials for FAANG/MAANG companies. All content is in Markdown format — no code.

## Contents
- 13 markdown files covering STAR method, Amazon LPs, Google Googleyness, company values, 7 question categories, level calibration, and story bank template
- 50+ interview questions mapped to company values
- STAR templates with good/bad examples and red flags

## When editing
- Keep STAR format consistent across all category files
- Always include: questions, STAR template, red flags, level calibration
- Map questions to Amazon LPs and Google traits
- Include quantified example results
- Reference 2024-2025 interview data where possible
